Riccardo.Veraldi@fi.infn.it writes:
 > 
 > Hello,
 > anyone could configure FreeBSD to support sound with Miata ??
 > thanks
 > 

Yes:

device        pcm0
device        sbc0


You need to make sure the sound is enabled from the SRM console as
well. 

Cheers,

Drew




